{"voice":"Leela","pages":[{"text":"One afternoon, a plate of warm cookies sat on the kitchen table.","words":[[0,0.23],[0.28,0.92],[0.94,0.99],[1.08,1.41],[1.43,1.5],[1.64,1.97],[2.07,2.53],[2.59,2.84],[2.91,3.01],[3.05,3.12],[3.18,3.56],[3.62,4.46]]},{"text":"There were six cookies on the plate.","words":[[0,0.3],[0.35,0.53],[0.61,0.94],[1.02,1.46],[1.53,1.64],[1.68,1.75],[1.81,2.55]]},{"text":"One child ate one cookie.","words":[[0,0.24],[0.3,0.65],[0.72,0.91],[0.96,1.14],[1.18,1.95]]},{"text":"Now there were fewer cookies than before.","words":[[0,0.23],[0.28,0.42],[0.46,0.63],[0.71,1.04],[1.13,1.54],[1.59,1.74],[1.81,2.83]]},{"text":"They counted carefully: one, two, three, four, five cookies left.","words":[[0,0.24],[0.3,0.7],[0.77,1.46],[1.92,2.28],[2.32,2.74],[2.8,3.2],[3.29,3.85],[3.96,4.32],[4.38,4.79],[4.87,5.57]]},{"text":"Later, another cookie was eaten.","words":[[0,0.55],[0.59,0.96],[1.02,1.33],[1.39,1.54],[1.61,2.32]]},{"text":"Now there were even fewer cookies on the plate.","words":[[0,0.28],[0.35,0.56],[0.6,0.81],[0.88,1.17],[1.31,1.71],[1.79,2.24],[2.3,2.39],[2.44,2.51],[2.57,3.39]]},{"text":"They counted again to see how many were left.","words":[[0,0.26],[0.33,0.77],[0.81,1.13],[1.2,1.29],[1.36,1.52],[1.58,1.74],[1.82,2.08],[2.13,2.32],[2.38,3.11]]},{"text":"Taking cookies away made the number smaller.","words":[[0,0.42],[0.49,0.92],[0.97,1.25],[1.32,1.53],[1.56,1.63],[1.7,2.02],[2.09,2.97]]},{"text":"They learned that when we take something away, we have fewer than before.","words":[[0,0.28],[0.36,0.73],[0.78,1.04],[1.14,1.38],[1.44,1.56],[1.64,1.93],[1.97,2.39],[2.47,2.98],[3.23,3.37],[3.42,3.62],[3.71,4.14],[4.21,4.39],[4.47,5.39]]}]}